## Hard rules / 硬性口径

1. 这是研究层面的候选发现器，不是交易策略；不能裸用，必须配合滚动 IC gate 与大盘情绪过滤
2. 回测数字是历史闭合窗口内的模型统计行为，不是真实盈亏；不得改写成收益承诺
3. 因子高度依赖游资活跃环境，样本内外 IC 显著分化，输出必须转达这些已知限制

1. This is a research-level candidate finder, not a trading strategy; never use it bare, always with the rolling IC gate and market-sentiment filter
2. Backtest figures are model statistics inside a closed historical window, not real P&L; never rewrite them as return promises
3. The factor depends on an active hot-money regime and in-sample vs out-of-sample IC diverge sharply; the output must relay these known limits

